#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf5/kf5-frameworks.xml:291
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"In the above list, notice that some files have been commented out with a "
"hash (#) character.  The extra-cmake-modules entry has been commented out "
"because it was built earlier in the <xref linkend=\"kde-prereq\"/>.  The "
"ki18n-5.115.0 package has been replaced by ki18n-5.115.1.  The icon packages"
" are covered separately at <xref linkend=\"breeze-icons\"/> and <xref "
"linkend=\"oxygen-icons\"/>.  The kdewebkit package may be built if the "
"external package <ulink "
"url=\"https://download.qt.io/community_releases/5.9/5.9.0-final/\"> "
"QtWebkit</ulink> has been built."
msgstr ""
"Na lista acima, note que alguns arquivos foram comentados com um caractere "
"cerquilha (#). A entrada extra-cmake-modules foi comentada porque foi "
"construída anteriormente na <xref linkend=\"kde-prereq\"/>. O pacote "
"ki18n-5.115.0 foi substituído pelo ki18n-5.115.1. Os pacotes de ícones são "
"abordados separadamente em <xref linkend=\"breeze-icons\"/> e <xref "
"linkend=\"oxygen-icons\"/>. O pacote kdewebkit pode ser construído se o "
"pacote externo <ulink "
"url=\"https://download.qt.io/community_releases/5.9/5.9.0-final/\">QtWebkit</ulink>"
" tiver sido construído."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf5/kf5-frameworks.xml:310
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of KDE Frameworks"
msgstr "Instalação do KDE Frameworks"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><caution><para>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf5/kf5-frameworks.xml:317
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If installing in <filename class=\"directory\">/opt</filename> and there is "
"an existing /opt/kf5 either as a regular directory or a symbolic link, it "
"should be reinitialized (as <systemitem class=\"username\"> "
"root</systemitem>):"
msgstr ""
"Se instalar em &quot;<filename class=\"directory\">/opt</filename>&quot; e "
"existir um &quot;/opt/kf5&quot;, seja como um diretório regular ou um link "
"simbólico, [então] ele deveria ser reinicializado (como &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;):"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><caution><screen>
#: blfs-en/kde/kf5/kf5-frameworks.xml:323
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mv -v /opt/kf5 /opt/kf5.old                         &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -dm755           $KF5_PREFIX/{etc,share} &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sfv /etc/dbus-1         $KF5_PREFIX/etc         &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sfv /usr/share/dbus-1   $KF5_PREFIX/share       &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sfv /usr/share/polkit-1 $KF5_PREFIX/share</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mv -v /opt/kf5 /opt/kf5.old                          &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -dm755           $KF5_PREFIX/{etc,share} &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sfv /etc/dbus-1         $KF5_PREFIX/etc         &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sfv /usr/share/dbus-1   $KF5_PREFIX/share       &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -sfv /usr/share/polkit-1 $KF5_PREFIX/share</userinput>"

